Notes on third-party material:

- `engine/src` is vendored from the arknights-video plugin (MIT) and the
  prts-terrarchive search engine (MIT, imported as an npm dependency at
  runtime); both were authored as MIT-licensed software and remain so.
- This repository ships NO game assets and NO corpus text. The PRTS corpus is
  downloaded separately by the user (`node bin/corpus-cli.mjs download`);
  PRTS wiki editorial content is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 by its authors, and
  any Arknights game imagery fetched for scene backgrounds remains the
  property of Hypergryph / Studio Montagne — fan-use only.
- This is an unofficial community project, not affiliated with Hypergryph or
  Studio Montagne (Arknights / 明日方舟).
